Note on third-party reference code
----------------------------------

A copy of the GPL-3.0-licensed project "Mole" may exist in this working tree
for behavioural reference only (it is excluded from version control via
.gitignore). squid is a clean-room implementation: it contains no code copied,
translated, or derived from Mole, and it is not linked against GPL code. The
GPL does not apply to the squid sources distributed under the terms above.
